{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-73508" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=8\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡({e}^{x}).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73508" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of arcsine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[8\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡({e}^{x})] \\\\  & =8\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{({e}^{x})}^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{1-{e}^{2x}}}\\cdot {e}^{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{8{e}^{x}}{\\sqrt{1-{e}^{2x}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73508" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52c1770a3c898baa573c29cfe4eeba2ee7763d760c05ae16c66e9617888bc845"} {"question" "q-73508" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73508" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{8{e}^{2x}}{\\sqrt{1-{e}^{x}}}"] ["math" "-\\frac{8{e}^{x}}{\\sqrt{1+{e}^{x}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{8{e}^{x}}{\\sqrt{1-{e}^{2x}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{{e}^{x}}{8\\sqrt{1+{e}^{2x}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{{e}^{x}}{8\\sqrt{1-{e}^{2x}}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73508" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{8{e}^{x}}{\\sqrt{1-{e}^{2x}}}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-86181" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x}{4}-\\frac{1}{4x}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-86181" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of arcsine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x}{4}-\\frac{1}{4x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x)+\\frac{1}{4{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}+\\frac{1}{4{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}+\\frac{1}{4{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-86181" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52c1770a3c898baa573c29cfe4eeba2ee7763d760c05ae16c66e9617888bc845"} {"question" "q-86181" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-86181" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}+\\frac{1}{2{x}^{2}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}+\\frac{1}{4{x}^{2}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}-\\frac{1}{2{x}^{2}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}+\\frac{1}{4{x}^{2}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-\\frac{1}{4{x}^{2}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-86181" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}+\\frac{1}{4{x}^{2}}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73507" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=5+9\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73507" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of arcsine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5+9\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x) \\\\  & =0+9\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x) \\\\  & =0+9\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73507" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52c1770a3c898baa573c29cfe4eeba2ee7763d760c05ae16c66e9617888bc845"} {"question" "q-73507" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73507" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{9}{\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "-\\frac{9}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{9\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{9}{\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{9}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73507" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{9}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-86179" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$  for $f(x)=4\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-86179" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of arcsine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)) \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)) \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(2x)^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x) \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-86179" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52c1770a3c898baa573c29cfe4eeba2ee7763d760c05ae16c66e9617888bc845"} {"question" "q-86179" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-86179" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1+4{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-2{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{1+2{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{1-2{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-86179" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110049" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)={arcsin}^{5}⁡(4x).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110049" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of arcsine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[{arcsin}^{5}⁡(4x)] \\\\  & =5{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(4x)] \\\\  & =5{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)\\cdot [\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(4x)^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4x)] \\\\  & =5{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)\\cdot [\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(4x)^{2}}}\\cdot 4] \\\\  & =5{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)\\cdot \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{20{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110049" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52c1770a3c898baa573c29cfe4eeba2ee7763d760c05ae16c66e9617888bc845"} {"question" "q-110049" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110049" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{20{arcsin}^{2}⁡(4x)}{\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{20{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{4{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{5{arcsin}^{4}⁡(2x)}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{5{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)}{\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110049" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{20{arcsin}^{4}⁡(4x)}{\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-343050" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+4\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\,$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-343050" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of arccosine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+4\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x) \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+4\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x) \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+4(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}) \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-343050" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52c1770a3c898baa573c29cfe4eeba2ee7763d760c05ae16c66e9617888bc845"} {"question" "q-343050" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-343050" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110625" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$  for $f(x)=5x+4\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110625" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of arccosine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5x+4\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x) \\\\  & =5+4\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x) \\\\  & =5+4(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}) \\\\  & =5-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110625" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52c1770a3c898baa573c29cfe4eeba2ee7763d760c05ae16c66e9617888bc845"} {"question" "q-110625" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110625" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "4-\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "5+\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "5-\\frac{4x}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "5-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "5x+\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110625" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "5-\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73500" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$  for $f(x)=2x-5\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73500" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of arccosine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x-5\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x) \\\\  & =2-5\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x) \\\\  & =2-5(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}) \\\\  & =2+\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73500" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_