ove, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(15\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x+8x) \\\\  & =15\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x)+8 \\\\  & =15(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}})+8 \\\\  & =8-\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110626" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52c1770a3c898baa573c29cfe4eeba2ee7763d760c05ae16c66e9617888bc845"} {"question" "q-110626" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110626" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "15-\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "8+\\frac{15x}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "8+\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "8-\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "8x-\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110626" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "8-\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73488" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$  for $f(x)=5-2\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73488" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of arccosine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5-2\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x) \\\\  & =0-2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x) \\\\  & =-2(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73488" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52c1770a3c898baa573c29cfe4eeba2ee7763d760c05ae16c66e9617888bc845"} {"question" "q-73488" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73488" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1+{x}^{2}}}"] ["math" "\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-73488" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-314735" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(5x-4)+2.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-314735" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of arctangent is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(5x-4)+2) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{1+{(5x-4)}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5x-4)+0 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{1+{(5x-4)}^{2}}\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{1+{(5x-4)}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-314735" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/activity-meta