\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x}{{e}^{x}}) & =\\frac{{e}^{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x)-\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x})}{{({e}^{x})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{x}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}-\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x\\cdot {e}^{x}}{{e}^{2x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}-\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x)}{{e}^{x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{e}^{x}\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}-\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x}{{e}^{x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110777" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52c1770a3c898baa573c29cfe4eeba2ee7763d760c05ae16c66e9617888bc845"} {"question" "q-110777" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110777" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{{e}^{x}}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}+\\frac{\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x}{{e}^{x}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}+\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x}{{e}^{x}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{{e}^{x}\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}-\\frac{\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x}{{e}^{x}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{{e}^{x}\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}-\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x}{{e}^{x}}"] ["math" "\\frac{{e}^{x}}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}-\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x}{{e}^{x}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110777" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{{e}^{x}\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}-\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x}{{e}^{x}}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-314738" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(2{x}^{3})}{{x}^{2}+5}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{6{x}^{2}}{({x}^{2}+5)(1+4{x}^{6})}\\,-$\n{{field-1}}\n$\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(2{x}^{3})$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-314738" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Applying the quotient rule, using the formula for the derivative of $\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x,$ and applying the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(2{x}^{3})}{{x}^{2}+5}) \\\\  & =\\frac{(({x}^{2}+5)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(2{x}^{3}))-\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(2{x}^{3})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2}+5))}{({x}^{2}+5)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(({x}^{2}+5)\\cdot \\frac{1}{1+(2{x}^{3})^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{3})-\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(2{x}^{3})\\cdot 2x)}{({x}^{2}+5)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\frac{({x}^{2}+5)(6{x}^{2})}{1+4{x}^{6}}-2x\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(2{x}^{3}))}{({x}^{2}+5)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{6{x}^{2}}{({x}^{2}+5)(1+4{x}^{6})}-\\frac{2x}{({x}^{2}+5)^{2}}\\,\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(2{x}^{3}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-314738" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52c1770a3c898baa573c29cfe4eeba2ee7763d760c05ae16c66e9617888bc845"} {"question" "q-314738" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-314738" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{2x}{(x^2+5)^2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110769" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ if  $f(x)=\\frac{{arctan}^{2}⁡(5x)}{{x}^{2}}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110769" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Applying the quotient rule, using the formula for the derivative of $\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x$ and applying the chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{{arctan}^{2}⁡(5x)}{{x}^{2}}] \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{2}\\cdot 2\\cdot \\operatorname{arctan}⁡(5x)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(5x))-(2x){arctan}^{2}⁡(5x)}{{x}^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2{x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{arctan}⁡(5x)\\cdot \\frac{5}{1+(5x)^{2}}-(2x){arctan}^{2}⁡(5x)}{{x}^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{10\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(5x)}{{x}^{2}(25{x}^{2}+1)}-\\frac{2}{{x}^{3}}\\cdot {arctan}^{2}⁡(5x).\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110769" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "52c1770a3c898baa573c29cfe4eeba2ee7763d760c05ae16c66e9617888bc845"} {"question" "q-110769" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110769" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{10\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(5x)}{{x}^{2}(25{x}^{2}+1)}-\\frac{2}{{x}^{3}}\\cdot {arctan}^{2}⁡(5x)"] ["math" "\\frac{10\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)}{{x}^{2}(5{x}^{2}+1)}-\\frac{1}{{x}^{3}}\\cdot {arctan}^{2}⁡(5x)"] ["math" "\\frac{25\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(5x)}{{x}^{2}(10{x}^{2}+1)}-\\frac{2}{{x}^{3}}\\cdot {arctan}^{2}⁡(5x)"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(5x)}{10{x}^{2}(25{x}^{2}+1)}+\\frac{1}{{x}^{3}}\\cdot {arctan}^{2}⁡(5x)"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(5x)}{{x}^{2}(25{x}^{2}+1)}+\\frac{2}{{x}^{3}}\\cdot {arctan}^{2}⁡(5x)"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "q-110769" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{10\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(5x)}{{x}^{2}(25{x}^{2}+1)}-\\frac{2}{{x}^{3}}\\cdot {arctan}^{2}⁡(5x)"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/state.json" "file_sha256" "a6bd91f604dd8c45e5915e1268896cd7244582ea065c395e55ff1af75feeb456"} {"question" "e-206" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $f'(x)$ for $f(x) = 5\\arcsin(3x^2).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/example-206.json" "file_sha256" "149d038455976efdb9734693647a2811a3e88d9a7fe66e204e323e4a3b0b987d"} {"question" "e-206" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of arcsine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}(\\arcsin x) = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(3{x}^{2})) \\\\  & =5\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(3{x}^{2})^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{1-9{x}^{4}}}\\cdot (6x) \\\\  & =\\frac{30x}{\\sqrt{1-9{x}^{4}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/example-206.json" "file_sha256" "149d038455976efdb9734693647a2811a3e88d9a7fe66e204e323e4a3b0b987d"} {"question" "e-203" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}y}{\\textrm{d}x},$ if $y = \\arccos (5-8x).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/example-203.json" "file_sha256" "bca1b434164a2f48832f2c6c672e22689ff44f4cf2faaaefa29c5af0fc4d7141"} {"question" "e-203" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of arccosine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}(\\arccos x) = -\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(5-8x)) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(5-8x)^{2}}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5-8x) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(25-80x+64{x}^{2})}}\\cdot (-8) \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{80x-24-64{x}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{4(20x-6-16{x}^{2})}} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{2\\sqrt{20x-6-16{x}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{20x-6-16{x}^{2}}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/example-203.json" "file_sha256" "bca1b434164a2f48832f2c6c672e22689ff44f4cf2faaaefa29c5af0fc4d7141"} {"question" "e-202" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the derivative of $y = \\arctan (-7x).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/example-202.json" "file_sha256" "78e49aecfcd7345983b72415a87113e6bdb87ba600b55e0b6ca030c9f19089f3"} {"question" "e-202" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of arctangent is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}(\\arctan x) = \\dfrac{1}{1+x^2}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(-7x)) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{1+(-7x)^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-7x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{1+49{x}^{2}}\\cdot (-7) \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{1+49{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/example-202.json" "file_sha256" "78e49aecfcd7345983b72415a87113e6bdb87ba600b55e0b6ca030c9f19089f3"} {"question" "e-204" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If $y= x \\arccos x,$ calculate $\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}y}{\\textrm{d}x}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/example-204.json" "file_sha256" "318e4f8a6e30f6e7ae6ce46090776e0a9c3970df9703fc5d8bd6d94dac6c199a"} {"question" "e-204" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Applying the product rule and using the formula for the derivative of $\\arccos x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x) & =x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x)+\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}})+\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}+\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979604/example-204.json" "file_sha256" "318e4f8a6e30f6e7ae6ce46090776e0a9c3970df9703fc5d8bd6d94dac6c199a"}] "usage" {"e-203" [] "e-202" [] "e-204" [] "e-206" []} "basis" 851 "retractions" [[17592186063926 :question/problem "Calculate $f'(x)$ for $f(x) = 5\\arcsin(3x^2)$."] [17592186063926 :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of arcsine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}(\\arcsin x) = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf^{′}(x) &= \\frac{d}{dx}(5\\arcsin (3x^{2})) \\\\\n&= 5 \\cdot (1)/(\\sqrt{1 - (3x^{2})^{2}}) \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}(3x^{2}) \\\\\n&= \\frac{5}{\\sqrt{1 - 9x^{4}}} \\cdot (6x) \\\\\n&= \\frac{30x}{\\sqrt{1 - 9x^{4}}}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186063924 :question/problem "Calculate $\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}y}{\\textrm{d}x}$, if $y = \\arccos (5-8x)$."] [17592186063924 :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of arccosine is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}(\\arccos x) = -\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{dy}{dx} &= \\frac{d}{dx}(\\arccos (5 - 8x)) \\\\\n&= - (1)/(\\sqrt{1 - (5 - 8x)^{2}}) \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}(5 - 8x) \\\\\n&= - (1)/(\\sqrt{1 - (25 - 80x + 64x^{2})}) \\cdot (-8) \\\\\n&= \\frac{8}{\\sqrt{80x - 24 - 64x^{2}}} \\\\\n&= (8)/(\\sqrt{4(20x - 6 - 16x^{2})}) \\\\\n&= \\frac{8}{2\\sqrt{20x - 6 - 16x^{2}}} \\\\\n&= \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{20x - 6 - 16x^{2}}}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186063923 :question/problem "Find the derivative of $y = \\arctan (-7x)$."] [17592186063923 :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of arctangent is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x}(\\arctan x) = \\dfrac{1}{1+x^2}\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{dy}{dx} &= \\frac{d}{dx}(\\arctan (-7x)) \\\\\n&= (1)/(1 + (-7x)^{2}) \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}(-7x) \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{1 + 49x^{2}} \\cdot (-7) \\\\\n&=-\\frac{7}{1 + 49x^{2}}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186063925 :question/problem "If $y= x \\arccos x$, calculate $\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}y}{\\textrm{d}x}$."] [17592186063925 :question/worked-solution "Applying the product rule and using the formula for the derivative of $\\arccos x$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{d}{dx}(x\\arccos x) &= x \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}(\\arccos x) + \\arccos x\\frac{d}{dx}(x) \\\\\n&= x \\cdot (-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - x^{2}}}) + \\arccos x \\cdot 1 \\\\\n&=-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1 - x^{2}}} + \\arccos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"]] "immutable_answers" [] "immutable_fields" [] "no_history" []}
